  <metadata>
    <name>Les Gavarres Circuit</name>
    <desc>A gravel loop through the cork oak forests and quiet backroads of the Gavarres massif. Links Girona to the medieval lanes of the Empordà lowlands via Cassà de la Selva and La Bisbal.</desc>
